/*!
    \page page-with-images.html
    \title Page With Images
    \brief A test page for image rendering.

    This paragraph contains an \inlineimage test-image.png {inline alt text} within the text flow.

    A block image followed by a caption with formatted pieces:

    \image test-image.png Block image alt text
    \caption Block image caption with \b{bold} text, \c{code},
             and a \l{page-with-images.html}{\b{nested} link}.

    An uncaptained image:

    \image test-image.png Uncaptained image alt text

    A list item containing a block image and a caption:

    \list
    \li The first item
        \image test-image.png List item image
        \caption \b{Bold} list caption with \c{code} and a \l{page-with-images.html}{link}.
    \endlist

    A table cell containing a block image and a caption:

    \table
    \row
        \li Cell text
        \li \image test-image.png Cell image
            \caption \b{Bold} cell caption with \c{code}.
    \endtable

    A value list in the shape of the QEasingCurve value documentation:

    \value FirstCurve     \image test-image.png {Graph of a
                           FirstCurve function}
                          \caption
                          Easing curve for a first function: accelerating
                          from zero velocity.
    \value SecondCurve    \image test-image.png {Graph of a
                           SecondCurve function}
                          \caption
                          Easing curve for a second function: decelerating
                          to zero velocity.
*/
